   "outcome_text": "root cause: Hurdle shape disabled + layer 2 vs mask 1 + player collision exception \u2014 no contact, walks through.\npatch: reset_to_spawn now un-excepts Hurdle, sets layer 1, enables Shape.\nwhy it satisfies: solid layer-1 bar blocks CharacterBody, E(t) stays \u22645px.\n",
